  cdx-emit-not-implemented : Integer = 2042

 CDX2043 was a second code for that same refusal, raised by
 emit-no-target-impl. Both are gone: emit-no-target-impl had no call
 site, so 2043 could not be raised by any program, and a code that
 cannot fire is a promise the compiler does not keep -- the same thing
 this paragraph exists to forbid. CDX2042 covers the case and is live.

